description=Only the System UI: the ROM's own System UI with the Belle Status menu, power menu and volume pop-up merged in. Keeps the lock screen, notifications and the hint bar. Android 11, AOSP test-key ROMs. The stock System UI comes back after 2 boots that do not come up.
